        "method": "Published author proof/core and local context fidelity screening",
        "note": "Complete author first-edge comparison: Definition3.1, full Propositions3.2–3.3, full Theorem3.4 inverse and representative checks, and full Proposition3.5 multiplication proof. The surface is compact oriented with distinguished boundary edge, shown at the right for stated tangles and at the left for the internal left action. Work over Q(q^(1/2)) or C with q^(1/2) nonzero and not a root of unity, with the exact unusual coribbon convention of Remark2.2. The internal object lives in the free cocompletion E=Oq2(SL2)-comod; the Temperley–Lieb generating subcategory and its extension are specified. Existing quantum-group semisimplicity, tangle generation and stated relations are author-cited background; the new explicit representing isomorphism and multiplication checks are present. Multi-edge, right-action and excision variants are not separately selected."
      },
